  "_note": "Walk SRM (app/[locale]/walk): the places, people and quests of the walkable campus. Places are matched by their OpenStreetMap name ('osm'; © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL) and positioned by scripts/build-campus-walk.mjs into public/walk/ktr-world.json. 'name' is what we show; it fixes OSM spellings (Hanger → Hangar) and casing, nothing else. People are roles, not real people. Quests are a game story; every fact a character tells you is read from our other content files when the page is built (see lib/walk.ts). Lines and descriptions are in messages/{en,ta,hi}.json under 'Walk'. Places OSM maps but doesn't name are matched by 'osmId' (the CRC Block: SRM's building list gives it G+8, so 'floors': 9; its position is from a public map listing, 12.82033, 80.03785).",
